# Thorough Planning Checklist

Before writing any implementation plan, agents MUST complete the thorough planning checklist covering: parallel codebase scan, systematic area checklist (10 areas), dependency tracing, data flow walkthrough, and gap analysis.

Every implementation plan MUST include: affected areas table, dependency map, per-layer changes, gap analysis, and risk notes.

For the full checklist and plan output requirements, read the `thorough-planning` skill.
